{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07297","headline":"会稽王处士草堂壁画衡霍诸山 · 刘长卿","name":"会稽王处士草堂壁画衡霍诸山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"粉壁衡霍近，羣峰如可攀。\n能令堂上客，见尽湖南山。\n青翠数千仞，飞来方丈间。\n归云无处灭，去鸟何时还？\n胜事日相对，主人常独闲。\n稍看林壑晚，佳气生重关。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07297.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07297","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}